  "readmeFile": "docs\\readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Refactored RSSendEmail with Google OAuth email-sending integration.\n\t\t  - Refactored FixErrors with configurable storage targets and added database logging.\n\t\t  - Added SendEmailDisplayName and SystemSendEmailDisplayName to RSAppSettings.\n\t\t  - Added GmailOauthActive, GmailOauthClientId, GmailOauthClientSecret, GmailOauthTokenStore, GmailOauthUsername, SystemGmailOauthActive, SystemGmailOauthClientId, SystemGmailOauthClientSecret, SystemGmailOauthTokenStore, and SystemGmailOauthUsername to RSAppSettings.\n\t\t  - Added FixErrorsEnable, FixErrorsFileSaveEnable, FixErrorsSendEmailEnable, and FixErrorsDatabaseEnable to RSAppSettings.\n\t\t  - Added fields RSSendSystemMail and SecurityProtocol to ModuloConfig.\n\t\t  - Added GetPublishInfo() to WCFCore.\n\t\t  - Added procedure AddParameters(parameters As IEnumerable...) to DataAccess.\n\t\t  - Removed SmtpDeliveryMethodHost, SmtpDeliveryMethodPort, and SmtpDeliveryMethodSSL from RSAppSettings.",
